cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "femur-fracture-classifier"
abstract: >-
  Config-driven machine-learning pipeline that classifies hip fracture type
  (neck vs trochanteric) from CT images of the femur combined with clinical features.
  The methods were developed in 2024; this repository is a refactored, documented
  release of that work.
authors:
